---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>HALO - The Identity Method for Lasting Change</title>
<meta name="description" content="Most change fails because you keep trying to force new behavior from an old identity. HALO shows you how to decide first, prove it in sixty seconds, and let repetition make it permanent. Install once. Live from there.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600&family=Caveat:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --evergreen:#0B3D30;
  --evergreen-deep:#082E24;
  --teal:#0F6E56;
  --teal-bright:#2E9C7C;
  --paper:#FCFBF7;
  --paper-shade:#F3F0E8;
  --card-rule:#C6D9E7;
  --card-headrule:#E2707A;
  --ink:#20302B;
  --ink-soft:#54655F;
  --pen:#17355F;
  --serif-display:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;
  --serif-body:'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;
  --hand:'Caveat',cursive;
  --mono:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
body{font-family:var(--serif-body);color:var(--ink);background:var(--evergreen);font-size:17px;line-height:1.65}
a{color:inherit}
::selection{background:var(--teal-bright);color:#fff}

/* -- Nav -- */
nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(11,61,48,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(252,251,247,.12)}
.nav-inner{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:.9rem 1.5rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.wordmark{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-weight:600;font-size:1.35rem;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--paper);text-decoration:none;position:relative}
.wordmark .ring{position:absolute;top:-.34em;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:1.15em;height:.38em;border:1.5px solid var(--teal-bright);border-radius:50%;opacity:.85}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:1.6rem;align-items:center;list-style:none}
.nav-links a{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(252,251,247,.75);text-decoration:none;transition:color .15s}
.nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a:focus-visible{color:var(--paper)}
.nav-cta{background:var(--paper);color:var(--evergreen)!important;padding:.5rem .95rem;border-radius:3px;font-weight:600}
.nav-cta:hover{background:#fff}
@media(max-width:720px){.nav-links li:not(:last-child){display:none}}

/* -- Hero -- */
.hero{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:5.5rem 1.5rem 6rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:4rem;align-items:center}
@media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:3.5rem;gap:3rem}}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal-bright);margin-bottom:1.4rem}
.hero h1{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(4.2rem,9vw,6.8rem);letter-spacing:.06em;line-height:.95;color:var(--paper);position:relative;display:inline-block}
.hero h1 .halo-ring{position:absolute;top:-.24em;left:.02em;width:.92em;height:.3em;border:3px solid var(--teal-bright);border-radius:50%;opacity:.9}
.hero .subtitle{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-weight:400;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.4vw,1.6rem);color:rgba(252,251,247,.92);margin-top:1.1rem}
.hero .tagline{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal-bright);margin-top:1rem}
.hero p.lede{color:rgba(252,251,247,.78);max-width:46ch;margin-top:1.6rem;font-size:1.05rem}
.hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:.9rem;margin-top:2.2rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:.9rem 1.5rem;border-radius:3px;transition:transform .12s,background .15s}
.btn:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--paper);color:var(--evergreen);font-weight:600}
.btn-primary:hover{background:#fff}
.btn-ghost{border:1px solid rgba(252,251,247,.35);color:var(--paper)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--paper)}

/* -- The index card -- */
.card-stage{perspective:1200px}
.index-card{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:430px;aspect-ratio:5/3.1;margin:0 auto;transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);cursor:pointer}
.index-card.flipped{transform:rotateY(180deg)}
.card-face{position:absolute;inset:0;backface-visibility:hidden;background:var(--paper);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45),0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.3);padding:1.4rem 1.6rem;overflow:hidden}
.card-face::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:2.6rem;height:2px;background:var(--card-headrule);opacity:.75}
.card-face .rules{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:4.4rem;bottom:1rem;background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 0,transparent 27px,var(--card-rule) 27px,var(--card-rule) 28px)}
.card-back{transform:rotateY(180deg)}
.card-label{position:relative;z-index:2;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.card-line{position:relative;z-index:2;margin-top:2.6rem;font-family:var(--serif-body);font-size:1.28rem;color:var(--ink)}
.card-line .written{font-family:var(--hand);font-size:1.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--pen);border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--card-rule);padding:0 .15em;min-width:8ch;display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap}
.caret{display:inline-block;width:2px;height:1.15em;background:var(--pen);vertical-align:-0.18em;animation:blink 1s steps(1) infinite}
@keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0}}
.card-footer{position:absolute;z-index:2;bottom:1rem;left:1.6rem;right:1.6rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.card-back .card-question{position:relative;z-index:2;margin-top:2.9rem;font-family:var(--hand);font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--pen);line-height:1.35}
.card-hint{text-align:center;margin-top:1.1rem;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(252,251,247,.5)}

/* -- Acronym strip -- */
.acronym{background:var(--evergreen-deep);border-top:1px solid rgba(252,251,247,.08);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(252,251,247,.08)}
.acronym-inner{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:2.4rem 1.5rem;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:clamp(1.2rem,4vw,3.5rem);flex-wrap:wrap}
.acronym span{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:clamp(1rem,2.2vw,1.45rem);color:var(--paper);letter-spacing:.02em}
.acronym b{color:var(--teal-bright);font-weight:600}

/* -- Paper sections -- */
.paper{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}
.section{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:5.5rem 1.5rem}
.kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal);margin-bottom:1rem}
.section h2{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.7rem);line-height:1.15;max-width:22ch}
.section .intro{max-width:60ch;margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:1.05rem}

/* Two lives */
.lives{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem}
@media(max-width:760px){.lives{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.life{border-radius:6px;padding:2rem 1.9rem}
.life h3{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:1.1rem}
.life ul{list-style:none}
.life li{padding:.55rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.07);font-size:1rem}
.life li:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.life-trying{background:var(--paper-shade);color:var(--ink-soft)}
.life-trying h3{color:var(--ink-soft)}
.life-decided{background:var(--evergreen);color:var(--paper)}
.life-decided li{border-bottom-color:rgba(252,251,247,.14)}
.life-decided .mark{color:var(--teal-bright)}
.life .mark{display:inline-block;width:1.4em;font-family:var(--mono)}

/* Four rules - index cards */
.rules-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem}
@media(max-width:760px){.rules-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.rule-card{position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E5E1D6;border-radius:6px;padding:1.5rem 1.6rem 1.7rem;box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(32,48,43,.06);overflow:hidden;transition:transform .18s,box-shadow .18s}
.rule-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(32,48,43,.12)}
.rule-card::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:2.4rem;height:2px;background:var(--card-headrule);opacity:.55}
.rule-num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--ink-soft);text-transform:uppercase}
.rule-card h3{font-family:var(--hand);font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--pen);margin-top:1.15rem}
.rule-card p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.97rem;margin-top:.5rem}

/* Path / timeline */
.path{border-left:2px solid var(--teal);margin:3rem 0 0 .4rem;padding-left:2rem;display:grid;gap:2.4rem}
.step{position:relative}
.step::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:calc(-2rem - 7px);top:.4em;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px var(--paper)}
.step .when{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal)}
.step h3{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:.3rem}
.step p{color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:56ch;margin-top:.35rem;font-size:.98rem}

/* Patricia */
.origin{background:var(--paper-shade)}
.origin-quote{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.4;max-width:26ch;color:var(--ink)}
.origin-attr{margin-top:1.6rem;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.origin-body{max-width:58ch;margin-top:1.6rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}

/* Inside the book */
.inside-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem}
@media(max-width:860px){.inside-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.inside{border-top:3px solid var(--teal);background:#fff;border-radius:0 0 6px 6px;padding:1.7rem 1.6rem;border-left:1px solid #E5E1D6;border-right:1px solid #E5E1D6;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E1D6}
.inside h3{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:600}
.inside p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.95rem;margin-top:.55rem}
.inside .tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal);display:block;margin-bottom:.7rem}

/* Epigraph */
.epigraph{background:var(--evergreen);color:var(--paper);text-align:center}
.epigraph .section{padding:4.5rem 1.5rem}
.epigraph p{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.4vw,2.3rem);line-height:1.35}
.epigraph .attr{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal-bright);margin-top:1.4rem}

/* Author */
.author-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:start;margin-top:2.6rem}
@media(max-width:700px){.author-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.author-mark{width:110px;height:110px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--evergreen);color:var(--paper);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:2rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.05em}
.author-grid p{max-width:62ch;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.author-grid p+p{margin-top:1rem}

/* Waitlist */
.waitlist{background:var(--evergreen-deep);color:var(--paper)}
.wl-card{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);border-radius:6px;padding:2.6rem 2.4rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.wl-card::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:3rem;height:2px;background:var(--card-headrule);opacity:.6}
.wl-card h2{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:600}
.wl-card p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:2rem;font-size:.98rem}
.wl-form{display:flex;gap:.7rem;margin-top:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.wl-form input{flex:1;min-width:220px;font-family:var(--serif-body);font-size:1rem;padding:.85rem 1rem;border:1.5px solid #D8D3C6;border-radius:3px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
.wl-form input:focus{outline:2px solid var(--teal);outline-offset:1px;border-color:var(--teal)}
.wl-form button{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;background:var(--evergreen);color:var(--paper);border:none;border-radius:3px;padding:.9rem 1.5rem;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s}
.wl-form button:hover{background:var(--teal)}
.wl-note{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:1rem!important}
.wl-confirm{display:none;margin-top:1.5rem;font-family:var(--hand);font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--pen)}
.comp-line{text-align:center;max-width:56ch;margin:3rem auto 0;color:rgba(252,251,247,.7);font-size:1rem}
.comp-line b{color:var(--paper);font-weight:600}

/* Footer */
footer{background:var(--evergreen-deep);border-top:1px solid rgba(252,251,247,.1)}
.footer-inner{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:2.2rem 1.5rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.footer-inner p{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:rgba(252,251,247,.5)}
.footer-inner .fm{color:rgba(252,251,247,.75);font-family:var(--serif-display);letter-spacing:.14em}

.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s ease}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--teal-bright);outline-offset:2px}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav aria-label="Main">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a class="wordmark" href="#top">H<span style="position:relative">A<span class="ring" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>LO</a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#method">The Method</a></li>
      <li><a href="#path">The Path</a></li>
      <li><a href="#origin">Origin</a></li>
      <li><a href="#inside">Inside</a></li>
      <li><a href="/app/">Open App</a></li>
      <li><a href="#waitlist" class="nav-cta">Join the Waitlist</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">The Identity Method for Lasting Change</p>
    <h1>H<span style="position:relative">A<span class="halo-ring" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>LO</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">The Identity Method for Lasting Change</p>
    <p class="tagline">Install once. Live from there.</p>
    <p class="lede">Most change fails because you keep trying to force new behavior from an old identity. HALO ends the negotiation: decide who you are first, prove it in the next sixty seconds, and let repetition make it permanent.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#waitlist">Join the Waitlist</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/app/">Open the App</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#method">See the Method</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div class="card-stage">
      <div class="index-card" id="heroCard" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="The HALO index card. Click to flip.">
        <div class="card-face card-front">
          <span class="card-label">The Card &mdash; Side One</span>
          <div class="rules" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <p class="card-line">I am <span class="written"><span id="typed"></span><span class="caret" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></p>
          <div class="card-footer"><span>Present tense</span><span>It already happened</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-face card-back">
          <span class="card-label">The Card &mdash; Side Two</span>
          <div class="rules" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <p class="card-question">What would the person I&rsquo;ve decided to be do right now?</p>
          <div class="card-footer"><span>One question</span><span>Sixty seconds</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="card-hint">Tap the card to flip it</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="acronym" aria-label="What HALO stands for">
  <div class="acronym-inner">
    <span><b>H</b>appened</span><span><b>A</b>lready.</span><span><b>L</b>ive</span><span><b>O</b>n.</span>
  </div>
</div>

<main>
<section class="paper" id="method">
  <div class="section">
    <p class="kicker reveal">The Problem</p>
    <h2 class="reveal">You&rsquo;ve been negotiating with yourself for years. The negotiation is the problem.</h2>
    <p class="intro reveal">Every morning the debate reopens: should I? can I? am I really the kind of person who&hellip;? That debate is the Trying Life, and it burns your energy before the day begins. There is another way to wake up.</p>
    <div class="lives">
      <div class="life life-trying reveal">
        <h3>The Trying Life</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span class="mark">&times;</span>Exhaustion from constant restarts</li>
          <li><span class="mark">&times;</span>Future-tense promises &mdash; &ldquo;I&rsquo;ll become&hellip;&rdquo;</li>
          <li><span class="mark">&times;</span>Every choice relitigated daily</li>
          <li><span class="mark">&times;</span>Wasted energy on the inner debate</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="life life-decided reveal">
        <h3>The Decided Life</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span class="mark">&check;</span>Present tense &mdash; &ldquo;I am&hellip;&rdquo;</li>
          <li><span class="mark">&check;</span>Energy spent on outcomes, not arguments</li>
          <li><span class="mark">&check;</span>Slips are noise, not verdicts</li>
          <li><span class="mark">&check;</span>Calmer, because the question is closed</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="paper" style="background:var(--paper-shade)">
  <div class="section">
    <p class="kicker reveal">The Method</p>
    <h2 class="reveal">Four rules. One card. Written by hand.</h2>
    <p class="intro reveal">HALO is not affirmations, and it is not manifestation. It is a conduct system: a decision made once, backed by immediate action, protected from renegotiation.</p>
    <div class="rules-grid">
      <div class="rule-card reveal">
        <span class="rule-num">Rule 01</span>
        <h3>Choose now.</h3>
        <p>Name the identity in the present tense. Not a goal, not a wish &mdash; a sentence that is already true the moment you write it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rule-card reveal">
        <span class="rule-num">Rule 02</span>
        <h3>Prove it through action.</h3>
        <p>Take one aligned step within sixty seconds. The brain updates on evidence, and the first evidence arrives immediately.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rule-card reveal">
        <span class="rule-num">Rule 03</span>
        <h3>Stop negotiating.</h3>
        <p>The decision is closed. You don&rsquo;t retry the case every morning. The question is no longer whether &mdash; only what comes next.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rule-card reveal">
        <span class="rule-num">Rule 04</span>
        <h3>Treat slips as noise. Reset quickly.</h3>
        <p>A slip is a single event. A relapse is a story. Return at the next scheduled opportunity, and the signal holds.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="paper" id="path">
  <div class="section">
    <p class="kicker reveal">The Path</p>
    <h2 class="reveal">From one sentence to a new default</h2>
    <div class="path">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <span class="when">Minute one</span>
        <h3>Sixty seconds</h3>
        <p>Write the card. Take one aligned action before the minute ends. The installation begins with proof, not preparation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <span class="when">Week one</span>
        <h3>The 7-Day Test</h3>
        <p>Each day, ask the card&rsquo;s question and act on the answer once. Record the proof. Seven days tells you whether the identity fits.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <span class="when">Weeks two to twelve</span>
        <h3>The quiet stretch</h3>
        <p>The world declines to comment while the identity transfers from decision to default. Boredom here isn&rsquo;t failure &mdash; it&rsquo;s the installer running.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <span class="when">Day ninety</span>
        <h3>The 90-Day Build</h3>
        <p>The debate has gone quiet. The conduct happens without a preceding act of will. You&rsquo;re not maintaining a change anymore. You&rsquo;re living from it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="origin paper" id="origin">
  <div class="section">
    <p class="kicker reveal">The Origin</p>
    <p class="origin-quote reveal">It began with a single sentence, spoken by a gym class instructor in Manhattan.</p>
    <p class="origin-attr reveal">For Patricia, who planted the seed</p>
